@startuml
title End-to-End Borrow & Return Activity (US-01 to US-09)

|Borrower|
start
:Login with TU Account (US-09);

|TU REST API|
:Verify Active Account & Role;

|Lender|
:Create Item Listing (US-01);

|Borrower|
:Browse Available Items (US-02);
:Submit Borrow Request (US-03);

|Lender|
:Review Request (US-05);
if (Approve?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Request -> ACCEPTED\nItem -> RESERVED;
else (No)
  |System|
  :Request -> REJECTED\nItem -> AVAILABLE;
  stop
endif

|Lender|
:Record Handover Evidence (US-06);

|System|
:Transaction -> ACTIVE\nItem -> BORROWED;

|Borrower|
:Use & Return Item;

|Lender|
:Record Return Evidence (US-07);

|System|
:Transaction -> COMPLETED\nItem -> AVAILABLE;

|Borrower|
:View History & Proofs (US-08);
stop
@enduml
